flowchart TD
  start([Start]) --> upload[Upload document]
  upload --> valid{Document valid?}
  valid -->|Valid| publish[Publish record]
  publish --> done([Record published])
  valid -->|Invalid| correct[Correct document]
  correct -->|Retry upload| upload
  valid -->|Service error| recovery[Manual recovery queue]
  recovery --> recovered{Service recovered?}
  recovered -->|Recovered| publish
  recovered -->|Still unavailable| recovery
